  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining the LinguaLive Scope**\n\nI\'m zeroing in on defining the scope for \"LinguaLive\". Currently, I\'m focusing on the core WebSocket communication for user pairing and audio/transcript transfer. I\'m also ensuring the integration of Gemini for real-time translation is well-defined as a component.\n\n\n**Refining the Workflow**\n\nI\'ve refined the workflow around the speech and translation process. Web Speech API will handle speech-to-text, then Gemini takes the transcribed text for translation, and then Web Speech API does the text-to-speech. This streamlines things considerably. I also realize a backend is essential for signaling and state sync between two users in a \"call\" across different devices. I need to investigate specific real-time/WebSocket requirements. I\'m visualizing the user flow as well: Home, Start/Join call, then translation.\n\n\n"
