  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing the Server**\n\nOkay, I\'m diving into the `server.ts` file now. I\'m focusing on setting up the Express routes and socket.io initialization. The Gemini API is slated to use `gemini-3.5-flash` for translations. My goal is to ensure smooth integration with Vite middleware for both development and production environments, so that is currently my focus.\n\n\n**Refining the API**\n\nI am now focusing on refining the `GoogleGenAI` integration to handle translations. I\'m exploring the `generateContent` method. The goal is to use the `gemini-pro` model for translation and ensure proper error handling within the socket event handlers, including the addition of a User-Agent header. I\'m working on data flow to manage the audio transcription and translations with socket events.\n\n\n**Implementing Translation Logic**\n\nI\'ve zeroed in on the translation functionality using Gemini. I am using `gemini-3.5-flash` to get direct translations. I have added an event handler to manage incoming text, along with error handling to manage the data flow effectively. I am making sure the output is concise, returning only translated text, no extras.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 7
      nanos: 415159244
    }
